cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OpticStream, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "OpticStream"
abstract: >-
  Prefect-based workflows and utilities for processing large microscopy and
  imaging datasets, including light-sheet microscopy (LSM) strips and
  polarization-sensitive optical coherence tomography (PS-OCT) tiles.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
url: https://opticstream.lincbrain.org
repository-code: https://github.com/lincbrain/opticstream
keywords:
  - microscopy
  - light-sheet microscopy
  - optical coherence tomography
  - PS-OCT
  - image processing
  - workflow orchestration
  - Prefect
  - LINC
authors:
